sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as FSM
  participant API as API /v1
  participant AG as Agent LangGraph
  participant C as core gates
  participant DB as Postgres

  Note over U,DB: Phase 1 - Session start
  U->>API: GET /v1/health/ready
  API-->>U: 200 ready true

  Note over U,DB: Phase 2 - Explore NL to SQL
  U->>API: POST /v1/conversations
  API-->>U: 201 conversation_id
  U->>API: POST /v1/conversations/c1/messages text
  API-->>U: 201 message_id run_id status running
  U->>U: I read the SQL and see the agent wrote txn_count over 1000
  Note over U: I want amount over 5000 card_type debit
  U->>API: GET /v1/runs/run-9c1/events SSE
  API-->>U: run.start
  API-->>U: tool_call.start run_sql
  AG->>C: validate_sql sqlglot
  C->>DB: SELECT as reference_readonly
  DB-->>C: rows
  C->>C: flags
  API-->>U: tool_call.done result_summary
  API-->>U: message.delta
  API-->>U: run.done message_id tokens
  U->>API: GET /v1/conversations/c1/messages/m1
  API-->>U: status success grounding sql explanation assumptions flags revisions rev-1

  Note over U,DB: Phase 3 - Edit plus re-run (Gap H sync)
  U->>API: POST /v1/conversations/c1/messages/m1/rerun sql
  API->>C: validate_sql and execute no LLM
  C->>DB: SELECT
  C-->>API: rows plus flags
  API-->>U: 200 message_id revision_id rev-2 result flags
  U->>API: GET /v1/conversations/c1/messages/m1
  API-->>U: revisions rev-2 rev-1 live is rev-2

  Note over U,DB: blip - my stream from the first run dies
  U->>API: GET /v1/runs/run-9c1
  API-->>U: status success
  U->>API: GET /v1/conversations/c1/messages/m1
  API-->>U: answer still there state is the product

  Note over U,DB: Phase 4 - Pin the insight (Gap B)
  U->>API: POST /v1/conversations/c1/insights message_id revision_id rev-2 sql
  API-->>U: 201 insight_id
  Note over U: pinned rev-2 exactly the SQL I saw (no silent swap)
  U->>API: GET /v1/conversations/c1/insights
  API-->>U: envelope insight cards
  U->>API: GET /v1/insights/ins-7
  API-->>U: insight detail with revision_id sql

  Note over U,DB: Phase 5 - Draft plus backtest (Gap C)
  U->>API: POST /v1/insights/ins-7/draft-rule
  API->>AG: draft WHERE from this insight
  API-->>U: 201 rule_id draft_where rationale
  U->>API: GET /v1/rules/r-3
  API-->>U: rule with status draft
  U->>U: tighten the WHERE
  U->>API: PATCH /v1/rules/r-3 where_clause
  API-->>U: 200 status draft
  U->>API: POST /v1/rules/r-3/backtest
  API->>C: backtest deterministic no LLM
  C->>DB: SELECT join fraud_labels
  C-->>API: TP FP FN TN precision recall FPR lift sample
  API-->>U: 201 BacktestResult metrics confusion coverage temporal sample
  Note over U: sample rows are there (I eyeball them before approving)
  U->>API: GET /v1/rules/r-3/backtests
  API-->>U: envelope backtest history
  U->>API: GET /v1/rules/r-3/backtests/bt-1
  API-->>U: full BacktestResult

  Note over U,DB: Phase 6 - Approve deploy catalog
  U->>API: POST /v1/rules/r-3/approve rationale actor
  API-->>U: 200 status approved approved_by
  U->>API: POST /v1/rules/r-3/deploy
  API->>C: rule_engine.deploy_rule mock
  API-->>U: 201 deployment_id external_rule_id
  U->>API: GET /v1/rules/r-3/deployment
  API-->>U: deployment record
  U->>API: GET /v1/rules?status=approved
  API-->>U: envelope catalog across conversations
  Note over U: later - rule misbehaves
  U->>API: POST /v1/rules/r-3/disable
  API-->>U: 200 disabled_at

  Note over U,DB: Phase 7 - Failure path (Gap A)
  Note over U: the model writes bad SQL (a red-team fixture)
  API-->>U: run.error code SQL_REJECTED
  U->>API: GET /v1/conversations/c1/messages/m1
  API-->>U: status error grounding null error code message details
